      "title": "繪俄史藝術高等學院",
      "paragraphs": [
        "開了一個簡單的學院繪圖企劃，",
        "所有人都可以自由創作，你可以讓OC進來當學生也可以讓你喜歡的主播入學",
        "創作標籤 <strong>#繪俄史藝術高等學院</strong>",
        "<a href=\"https://x.com/INU_Art_/status/2063560036207788289\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">from @INU_Art_ on X (Twitter)</a>"
      ],
      "more": { "label": "學院更多資訊（點我了解）", "url": "https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1shdC0tnMT_nGfyltAsgkMDdvRAeVlyvSXHu8VXYxjDA/edit?usp=sharing" },
